</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Christensen</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Dalsgaard</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Froese</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Torres</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Fishing down marine food webs.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>279(5352)</volume><fpage>860</fpage><lpage>863</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9452385</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005333-Worm1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Worm</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbier</surname><given-names>EB</given-names></name><name><surname>Beaumont</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Duffy</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Folke</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Impacts of biodiversity loss on ocean ecosystem services.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>314(5800)</volume><fpage>787</fpage><lpage>790</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17082450</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005333-Worm2"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Worm</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Sandow</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Oschlies</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Lotze</surname><given-names>HK</given-names></name><name><surname>Myers</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Global patterns of predator diversity in the open oceans.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>309(5739)</volume><fpage>1365</fpage><lpage>1369</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16051749</pub-id></citation></ref>